          "widget": {
            "name": "ops_money_note",
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "### Why cost is smooth and savings are spiky\nOperational cost tracks alert **volume** — reviews and false-positive friction — so it moves with traffic. Gross savings tracks transaction **value**, and one large fraudulent transfer moves it more than a busy hour of small ones. A spiky benefit line against a flat cost line is the expected shape, not an anomaly.\n\n`operational_cost = review_cost + false_positive_friction_cost` — the same two components the business impact dashboard subtracts. One definition of cost across both pages."
              ]
            }
          },
